<Quest name="The Dragon&apos;s Treasure">
   <Part id="0">
      <Description done="no">You have heard rumors of a Dragon who guards a mighty treasure.  You should search for clues to its whereabouts in a young Dragon&apos;s cave.  Location: %s.</Description>
      <Description done="yes" first="yes">Although you only found and slew a small dragon, you discovered the name of the greater dragon: Auravorax.</Description>
      <Description done="yes" first="no">Although you were not the first to reach this ruin, you found a clue: the name of the dragon you seek is Auravorax.</Description>
      <Success first="yes">With its dying breath, the young Dragon curses you, saying that its mother, Auravorax, will hunt you down.  Perhaps Auravorax is the dragon you seek.</Success>
      <Success first="no">You discover only the body of a Dragon.  A search through some books in its lair soon reveals that it is the offspring of a huge Wyrm named Auravorax. Perhaps Auravorax is the dragon you seek.</Success>
      <Reward type="gold" data="1025">Although it was a young Dragon, it still has considerable treasure.  You discover 1025 Gold!</Reward>
      <Monster type="52" number="1" level="3"/>
   </Part>
   <Part id="1">
      <Description done="no">Few would know the whereabouts of this old Dragon except the Council of Liches.  You must confront and defeat them. Location: %s.</Description>
      <Description done="yes" first="yes">Although you still did not find the location of the Dragon&apos;s lair, you discovered that a magical lodestone might point you towards it.</Description>
      <Description done="yes" first="no">Although you were too late to question the Council of Liches, you discovered that a magical lodestone might point you towards it.</Description>
      <Success first="yes">The Liches are defeated.  All they can tell you is that you will need a magical lodestone to point to the Dragon&apos;s lair.</Success>
      <Success first="no">The Council of Liches is long gone.  However you discover some evidence that a magical lodestone might point you towards the lair.</Success>
      <Reward type="mana" data="2">With the Liches defeated, you also discover the source of their power: 2 Mana Crystals.</Reward>
      <Monster type="31" number="7" level="2"/>
      <Monster type="31" number="1" level="10"/>
   </Part>
   <Part id="2">
      <Description done="no">You must gather a magical lodestone.  It will point you towards the lair of Auravorax.  Location: %s.</Description>
      <Description done="yes" first="yes">You slew a Goblin Shaman and discovered a magical lodestone to point towards the lair of Auravorax.</Description>
      <Description done="yes" first="no">You discovered a magical lodestone to point towards the lair of Auravorax in an empty lair.</Description>
      <Success first="yes">You have slain an old Goblin Shaman who was guarding a cache of magical lodestones.  You take one to aid in your quest.</Success>
      <Success first="no">Although this site is long deserted, you still find a magical lodestone to help locate the lair.</Success>
      <Reward type="xp" data="16">As well as the magical lodestones, the Goblin shaman has a potion that increases your experience (by +16).</Reward>
      <Monster type="24" number="1" level="20"/>
   </Part>
   <Part id="3">
      <Description done="no">Finally you have discovered the lair of Auravorax.  All that remains is to slay the beast and take its treasure. Location: %s.</Description>
      <Description done="yes" first="yes">You have slain Auravorax and taken all of her treasure. The quest is complete.</Description>
      <Description done="yes" first="no">Auravorax is slain and his treasure is taken. You were too late to complete the quest.</Description>
      <Success first="yes">You have slain the mighty Auravorax, and all of her treasure is now yours.</Success>
      <Success first="no">Unfortunately, Auravorax is already dead and her treasure hoard has been taken.</Success>
      <Reward type="gold" data="20546">The lair of Auravorax is filled with golden coins and jewellery.  You manage to collect 20546 Gold!</Reward>
      <Monster type="52" number="1" level="25" name="Auravorax"/>
   </Part>
</Quest>
